{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your intuition against 2 opponents with an arsenal of 21 available powerups. No limit on the number of rounds you can play means unlimited fun (if you want to call it that).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GUESS RIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guess the finger total (the hand sum, if you will) in this game of intuition. Play your hand carefully, because there\u2019s more than just the win at stake.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/fb1e2f3131f315b34a4a41d07c1531e6.poster.avif?t=1758920586\" width=710 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/fb1e2f3131f315b34a4a41d07c1531e6.webm?t=1758920586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/fb1e2f3131f315b34a4a41d07c1531e6.mp4?t=1758920586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >USE POWERUPS\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Never face a battle of wits alone. Randomly assigned powerups will give you the upper hand as you play each new round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/7eb8cc36012056ffd70ec2623d19f85a.poster.avif?t=1758920586\" width=710 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/7eb8cc36012056ffd70ec2623d19f85a.webm?t=1758920586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/7eb8cc36012056ffd70ec2623d19f85a.mp4?t=1758920586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEFEAT ENEMIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your enemies fingerless to make your way up to Atropos. You\u2019ll get your revenge and slip through their hands to make your escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/18455183c514f1a9f242368005946ce3.poster.avif?t=1758920586\" width=710 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/18455183c514f1a9f242368005946ce3.webm?t=1758920586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/18455183c514f1a9f242368005946ce3.mp4?t=1758920586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IMMERSIVE VISUALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in a beautifully crafted claymation and stop-motion miniature set-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/d5ff64d7cd8f9474742d02b1015357f5.poster.avif?t=1758920586\" width=710 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/d5ff64d7cd8f9474742d02b1015357f5.webm?t=1758920586\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032210/extras/d5ff64d7cd8f9474742d02b1015357f5.mp4?t=1758920586\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032210?t=1758920586","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4032210?t=1758920586","capsule_image":"http